<Page current="about" title="About — It's Not Easy Being Bjorn"><div class="inner">
<p>
  Bjorn is perceptive, conscientious, and tired. He spots the problem,
  does the work, and tries to be decent—even when everyone around him
  makes that unnecessarily difficult. He rarely gets much say in things,
  but somehow ends up responsible for how they turn out.
</p>

<p>
  The stories are about everyday absurdities, misplaced blame, and
  the price of being the person who gives a damn. They just happen
  to involve cavemen.
</p>

<p>
  The concepts and scripts are my own work. The images are generated
  with ChatGPT because I’m not a very good artist. Bjorn deserves
  better than my stick figures; he’s dealing with enough already.
</p>
</div>
</Page>
